OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 20 DEC
OL,4,G1300FMusic Matters: In the Beginning
OL,5,     GComposer James MacMillan explores
OL,6,     Gmusic inspired by the biblical
OL,7,     Gstory of creation and humanity's
OL,8,     Gfascination with the universe.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GAndrew McGregor picks the best
OL,11,     Gnew classical albums for the
OL,12,     Gfestive period, with Sarah Walker
OL,13,     Gand Jonathan Cross, who chooses
OL,14,     Ghis top recording of
OL,15,     GTchaikovsky's Winter Daydreams.
OL,16,G1600FSound Of Cinema
OL,17,     GCelebrate the season with Edith
OL,18,     GBowman as she shares the most
OL,19,     Gmagical Christmas music from the
OL,20,     Gmovies, with a festive Pick of
OL,21,     Gthe Flicks from BBC Breakfast
OL,22,     Gpresenter John Kay.
